  "description": "KEL (Kelly Rose Moncado) is an Italian-Maltese vocalist, songwriter, and performer born in Agrigento, Sicily on August 8, 1994. Raised between Sicily and Malta with additional German cultural influences, she began singing at age four and started formal vocal training at eight. Her artistic philosophy is defined by the motto 'Music is fluid,' reflecting her genre-blending approach that fuses Mediterranean traditions, Eastern influences, and contemporary electronic production. KEL has built an international career as a featured vocalist and solo artist, collaborating with major DJs/producers across Europe.",
